{
  "title": "Without DNS Test Page",
  "story": [
    {
      "id": "a1a1a1a1a1a1a1a1",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "A frozen page for one experiment: it is read by name, then by a given address, and must be the same page."
    },
    {
      "id": "b2b2b2b2b2b2b2b2",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "Its identity is the site it belongs to and its slug, not the address it is read from."
    },
    {
      "id": "c3c3c3c3c3c3c3c3",
      "type": "code",
      "text": "(defun same-page-p (a b) (equal (sha256 a) (sha256 b)))",
      "language": "lisp"
    }
  ],
